  - m_Id: 5707318296696
    m_Localized: "使用物品"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296697
    m_Localized: "丢弃"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296698
    m_Localized: "够不到任何东西。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296699
    m_Localized: "马桶堵了，我找不到搋子。它在一个桶里的某个地方，但我不记得在哪里了。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
